  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the real roots of the equation<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is equal to:"
  },
