  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On expansion, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Here all roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are real, hence the sum of the real roots is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
